@startuml
title Profile Feature — State Machine
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Loading : Load event
Loading --> Loaded : username loaded
Loading --> Error : load failed
Loaded --> Editing : Update(value)
Editing --> Editing : Update(value)
Editing --> Saving : Save event
Saving --> Loaded : save success
Saving --> Error : save failed
Error --> Loading : Retry
Error --> Idle : Cancel
@enduml
